# An allowlist: nothing goes into the image unless it is named here. That keeps .env (real keys), saved logins,
# runs/, the virtualenv, tests and drafts out of it by construction, not by remembering to exclude each one.
*

!api/
!website_test_pipeline/
!static/
!conftest.py
!pyproject.toml
!AI-TEST-GUIDE.md
!persona.txt
!requirements-prod.txt

# even inside the allowed folders
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/*.key
